"""Tables heroes4.exe builds in code (not in the game's data files), as quoted
in Anbrose/homm4-mac (native/Sources/H4Engine: Tables.swift, Spells.swift,
ArtifactEffects.swift; MIT License, (c) 2026 Anton Ozhigin). Generated once
from there; only the data, as plain Python.

ARTIFACT_IDS    artifact id -> keyword (table.Artifacts "Keyword")
SKILL_IDS       skill id -> keyword (9 primaries, then 3 secondaries per primary)
HERO_CLASSES    class id -> (keyword, alignment, skill ids)
SPELL_KEYWORDS  spell id -> keyword
CREATURE_SPELLS creature keyword -> spell ids it casts (first with Default flag = default)
ARTIFACT_EFFECTS artifact id -> effects; CLASS_EFFECTS class id -> effects
  effect: type (see EFFECT_TYPES), target (0 bearer, 1 enemy creatures,
  2 enemy heroes, 3 friendly creatures, 4 other friendly heroes, 5 all),
  amount, and only the fields that differ from their defaults.
"""


